graph TD
    A["<b>Firmware</b> — UEFI or BIOS<br/><i>knows about disks, not filesystems</i>"]
    A -->|"reads the EFI system partition"| B["<b>Bootloader</b> — GRUB, systemd-boot<br/><i>picks a kernel, assembles a command line</i>"]
    B -->|"loads two files into memory"| C["<b>Kernel</b> + <b>initramfs</b>"]
    C --> D["Kernel unpacks the initramfs<br/>into a RAM filesystem and runs <b>/init</b>"]
