    E -->|"<b>switch_root</b> — pivot to the real root,<br/>free the RAM disk"| F["<b>/sbin/init</b> — PID 1<br/><i>usually systemd</i>"]
    F --> G["Units, in dependency order,<br/>until the default target is reached"]
